<div class="vtmlarp-chargen-guide">
  <p class="hint">This table's house-rules chargen sheet - replaces the standard rulebook process. The same content also lives in the Rules Reference compendium as "Custom Rulebook Character Creation Sheet."</p>

  <h3>Character Creation Steps</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Clan &amp; Sect:</strong> Select clan and political affiliation - check the Clan Population Limits and Restricted Paths sections below first.</li>
    <li><strong>Nature &amp; Demeanor:</strong> Select psychological archetypes.</li>
    <li><strong>Path:</strong> Select moral code/Path of Enlightenment.</li>
    <li><strong>Generation:</strong> Starting generation must fall between 15th and 10th generation.</li>
    <li><strong>Attributes (Physical / Social / Mental):</strong> 7 / 5 / 3 distribution.</li>
    <li><strong>Abilities:</strong> 11 points to distribute.</li>
    <li><strong>Disciplines:</strong> 5 dots to spend, maximum 3 dots in any single Discipline at start.</li>
    <li><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> 5 dots.</li>
    <li><strong>Virtues:</strong> 10 points across Instinct, Self-Control, and Courage.</li>
    <li><strong>Willpower:</strong> Starts at 4.</li>
    <li><strong>Blood Pool:</strong> Determined by starting Generation.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Freebies &amp; Flaws:</strong> 12 base freebie points. Max 7 bonus points from Flaws.
      Optional: take 1 Derangement for +2 more freebie points (max potential pool: 21).
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Clan Discipline Swapping Rule</h3>
  <p>Players may trade out any one of their clan's standard listed Disciplines for an alternative common Discipline below. Never Thaumaturgy or Vicissitude - those stay clan-exclusive.</p>

  <h3>Alternative Common Disciplines</h3>
  <ul class="vtm-chargen-columns">
    <li>Celerity</li>
    <li>Potence</li>
    <li>Fortitude</li>
    <li>Auspex</li>
    <li>Animalism</li>
    <li>Presence</li>
    <li>Obfuscate</li>
    <li>Dominate</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Clan Population Limits &amp; Restrictions</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>True Brujah:</strong> Max 1 (Storyteller Approval Required)</li>
    <li><strong>Baali:</strong> Max 1 (Storyteller Approval Required)</li>
    <li><strong>Kiasyd:</strong> Max 1 (Storyteller Approval Required)</li>
    <li><strong>Cappadocian:</strong> Max 1</li>
    <li><strong>Tremere:</strong> Max 2 at a given time</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Restricted Paths &amp; Rituals (Storyteller Approval Required)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Mastery of the Mortal Shell</li>
    <li>Path of Father's Vengeance</li>
    <li>Path of the Focused Mind</li>
    <li>Path of the Levinbolt</li>
    <li>Path of Technomancy</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="hint">Every Discipline/Power on these 5 Paths already shows a red "ST" badge on the character sheet as a reminder.</p>

  <h3>Additional Rules &amp; Information</h3>
  <p><strong>Caitiff &amp; Pander:</strong> Can select any 3 Disciplines, clan-specific or not.</p>
</div>
